      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "The Output's Render section is open: a GIF at 25 FPS, four seconds long. That is the Master Gear's caption, loops in 1 cycle \u00b7 4.000 s, since everything moving is on that gear, so the film ends exactly where it began. Press Render and it is written to renders/ in the project. Change the gear's Length, then set Duration to what its caption says."
